WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:03.250
<b>I see.</b>

00:03.380 --> 00:06.630
<b>That concludes our questioning
about the incident.</b>

00:07.470 --> 00:12.430
<b>You're saying Viola was behind
all the backlash in your former group,</b>

00:12.550 --> 00:15.770
<b>but you have no proof
to substantiate that.</b>

00:15.930 --> 00:20.150
<b>So, this is nothing more
than a personal dispute.</b>

00:20.270 --> 00:21.060
<b>Yes.</b>

00:21.310 --> 00:25.360
<b>But the whole incident
indeed started with Viola.</b>

00:25.530 --> 00:26.690
<b>That's true.</b>

00:27.190 --> 00:30.860
<b>She practically put Arale
on that stage herself.</b>

00:31.490 --> 00:35.160
<b>We've received a formal apology
from their agency.</b>

00:35.290 --> 00:38.660
<b>They'll be questioning her
on their end as well.</b>

00:39.670 --> 00:41.960
<b>- Clematis-san.
- Yes.</b>

00:42.080 --> 00:47.260
<b>Once the agency issues
an official apology for this incident,</b>

00:47.380 --> 00:50.930
<b>we'd like you to continue
with Fairy Bouquet.</b>

00:51.430 --> 00:54.260
<b>But based on what you've told us today,</b>

00:54.390 --> 00:56.680
<b>you have no intention
of staying, correct?</b>

00:56.810 --> 00:57.600
<b>I don't.</b>

00:58.310 --> 00:59.310
<b>Understood.</b>

00:59.520 --> 01:02.810
<b>Well then, as stated in your contract,
after you...</b>

01:02.940 --> 01:04.560
<b>Wait!</b>

01:06.480 --> 01:11.450
<b>This incident was all my fault.</b>

01:14.030 --> 01:16.160
<b>I'm truly sorry.</b>

01:16.410 --> 01:18.160
<b>You're not supposed to be here.</b>

01:18.290 --> 01:21.370
<b>No, Clematis isn't to blame.</b>

01:21.500 --> 01:24.750
<b>I was the one who found Arale-chan</b>

01:24.880 --> 01:28.090
<b>and called out to her without thinking.</b>

01:28.210 --> 01:31.630
<b>Clematis was so busy
and nervous about the event,</b>

01:31.760 --> 01:34.640
<b>and I knew she was under
a lot of pressure.</b>

01:35.050 --> 01:38.390
<b>And that's exactly why
I wanted them to make up.</b>

01:38.770 --> 01:40.680
<b>I couldn't help it.</b>

01:41.440 --> 01:46.190
<b>This is entirely my responsibility.
Clematis did nothing wrong.</b>

01:46.320 --> 01:47.570
<b>So, please...</b>

01:50.240 --> 01:51.450
<b>Don't make her leave.</b>

01:52.570 --> 01:56.490
<b>Just arrange for her
to transfer to MewType. How's that?</b>

01:57.660 --> 01:58.790
<b>That's way too...</b>

01:58.910 --> 02:00.250
<b>Clematis...</b>

02:00.540 --> 02:04.170
<b>Ritsu deserves more
than to have it end like this.</b>

02:06.080 --> 02:07.170
<b>Also...</b>

02:07.920 --> 02:12.470
<b>I think Ritsu would be
happier with Arale-chan.</b>

02:16.680 --> 02:18.850
<b>This isn't our decision to make,</b>

02:19.220 --> 02:21.730
<b>so we'll consult with their agency.</b>

02:22.520 --> 02:24.140
<b>Thank you.</b>

02:26.270 --> 02:27.480
<b>Excuse me.</b>

02:30.230 --> 02:32.070
<b>What exactly do you want?</b>

02:38.740 --> 02:41.290
<b>Did you enjoy the apple?</b>

02:42.830 --> 02:48.040
<b>Breaking taboos, crossing the line...</b>

02:48.170 --> 02:53.380
<b>Doing what you're forbidden to do
feels good, doesn't it?</b>

02:53.800 --> 02:55.470
<b>But what a shame.</b>

02:55.590 --> 03:00.470
<b>Girls who don't obey
have to be cast out of paradise.</b>

03:01.930 --> 03:03.810
<b>It's sad,</b>

03:04.480 --> 03:08.190
<b>but from now on,
things will get a lot more interesting.</b>

03:10.190 --> 03:12.860
<b>Be good friends with Arale-chan, okay?</b>

03:13.280 --> 03:15.990
<b>I'm not your toy anymore.</b>

03:18.450 --> 03:20.030
<b>Really?</b>

03:20.870 --> 03:22.620
<b>No longer a model student?</b>

03:23.290 --> 03:24.910
<b>Congratulations.</b>

03:37.930 --> 03:42.430
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

03:43.640 --> 03:48.060
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

03:48.310 --> 03:53.110
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

03:53.400 --> 03:58.320
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

03:58.490 --> 04:03.240
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

04:03.450 --> 04:07.410
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

04:07.540 --> 04:14.050
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

04:14.170 --> 04:18.930
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

04:19.260 --> 04:23.890
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

04:24.060 --> 04:27.730
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

04:27.890 --> 04:33.400
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

04:33.520 --> 04:38.110
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

04:38.400 --> 04:42.740
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

04:42.870 --> 04:45.990
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

04:46.120 --> 04:49.460
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

04:49.620 --> 04:52.790
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

04:52.920 --> 04:54.290
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

04:54.460 --> 04:59.590
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

05:00.050 --> 05:02.470
<b>Shiroyama</b>

05:00.550 --> 05:02.470
<b>Why?!</b>

05:02.800 --> 05:04.600
<b>Ricchan!!</b>

05:04.760 --> 05:07.060
<b>No matter the angle,</b>

05:07.180 --> 05:10.100
<b>you still look just like Ricchan.</b>

05:10.730 --> 05:12.600
<b>But why would she come here?</b>

05:13.270 --> 05:14.770
<b>Was it the backlash?!</b>

05:14.900 --> 05:17.190
<b>No, I already had my own reasons.</b>

05:18.030 --> 05:19.610
<b>Oh okay.</b>

05:19.740 --> 05:21.320
<b>This...</b>

05:21.820 --> 05:23.990
<b>This is something I chose for myself.</b>

05:25.490 --> 05:28.250
<b>- Hey.
- Arale-chan.</b>

05:28.410 --> 05:32.370
<b>Won't you introduce
your wonderful friend to us?</b>

05:32.500 --> 05:34.670
<b>Well, we've already met once.</b>

05:34.790 --> 05:36.170
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

05:36.710 --> 05:40.050
<b>I'm Ritsu Minetsuki,
and I will be studying with you</b>

05:40.170 --> 05:43.300
<b>in Class 1-B at Kanda Shiroyama Academy.</b>

05:43.640 --> 05:45.800
<b>This is a small token of friendship.</b>

05:47.350 --> 05:48.600
<b>A Baru-kun pork bun!</b>

05:48.770 --> 05:50.390
<b>Freshly steamed!</b>

05:52.190 --> 05:53.850
<b>Here. This one's for you.</b>

05:55.110 --> 05:55.900
<b>Okay, then.</b>

05:56.020 --> 05:57.820
<b>Cheers!</b>

05:59.900 --> 06:02.150
<b>You're surprisingly very lively.</b>

06:02.280 --> 06:05.200
<b>Wasn't Clematis more
like Prince Charming?</b>

06:05.320 --> 06:07.200
<b>That was just a character.</b>

06:07.580 --> 06:08.660
<b>So it wasn't real.</b>

06:08.790 --> 06:12.210
<b>Yeah, I guess you don't really
seem like a prince.</b>

06:12.330 --> 06:15.170
<b>- Really?
- You're more of a cutie.</b>

06:15.290 --> 06:16.080
<b>"A cutie"?</b>

06:16.250 --> 06:18.960
<b>Your live show was so cool, though!</b>

06:19.090 --> 06:20.510
<b>Yeah, MewType's show!</b>

06:20.670 --> 06:22.380
<b>You were so cool with your guitar.</b>

06:22.510 --> 06:23.590
<b>Thank you.</b>

06:23.720 --> 06:25.640
<b>Can you play air guitar here?</b>

06:26.760 --> 06:29.390
<b>- I can try.
- Really?</b>

06:30.390 --> 06:32.350
<b>Oh, Miyako-chan!</b>

06:32.520 --> 06:33.730
<b>I'll give you first aid!</b>

06:34.730 --> 06:36.610
<b>Are you all right?</b>

06:37.730 --> 06:41.150
<b>Since you're tired,
here's a big squeeze!</b>

06:42.740 --> 06:46.160
<b>You must be here for
the transfer student.</b>

06:46.320 --> 06:49.950
<b>Let's go meet the real Ricchan!</b>

06:50.580 --> 06:54.620
<b>Welcome to Kamiuma Academy!</b>

06:54.750 --> 06:55.710
<b>"Kamiuma"?</b>

06:55.870 --> 06:58.080
<b>Kanda Shiroyama
Pegasus! So cool</b>

06:56.000 --> 06:59.460
<b>It was taken
from Kanda Shiroyama Academy.</b>

06:59.630 --> 07:02.550
<b>Thank you for the warm welcome,
Miyanaga-senpai.</b>

07:02.670 --> 07:05.470
<b>No, no. Call me Nono-chan.</b>

07:05.720 --> 07:06.800
<b>Okay?</b>

07:06.930 --> 07:08.220
<b>Okay, Nonoka-san.</b>

07:08.350 --> 07:12.520
<b>Oh, no, no, no.
Nono-chan.</b>

07:12.890 --> 07:15.980
<b>- Nono-chan.
- Yes, that's perfect.</b>

07:16.100 --> 07:18.520
<b>Right, Arale-kun?</b>

07:18.650 --> 07:19.900
<b>Yes!</b>

07:22.940 --> 07:24.440
<b>It's ramen!</b>

07:24.570 --> 07:27.490
<b>I decided to go
all out for my first day.</b>

07:29.120 --> 07:31.740
<b>What are you two having for lunch?</b>

07:32.330 --> 07:38.080
<b>Today, I will be having this
fluffy egg sandwich.</b>

07:38.790 --> 07:39.920
<b>Rice balls.</b>

07:40.040 --> 07:44.090
<b>Whoa, Japanese, Western, Chinese!</b>

07:44.210 --> 07:47.220
<b>And now, Nono-chan's lunch is...</b>

07:47.930 --> 07:50.260
<b>The "Nono" bento!</b>

07:51.140 --> 07:52.100
<b>Pretty simple.</b>

07:52.220 --> 07:55.310
<b>All the toppings
are hidden under the rice.</b>

07:55.430 --> 07:57.350
<b>- It's a surprise.
- Miyako-san!</b>

07:57.770 --> 07:58.980
<b>About yesterday...</b>

07:59.100 --> 08:01.150
<b>Oh, no!</b>

08:01.270 --> 08:04.320
<b>I totally forgot I had a manuscript due.</b>

08:04.440 --> 08:05.530
<b>This is bad.</b>

08:05.690 --> 08:08.780
<b>Oh no! My manuscript!</b>

08:08.910 --> 08:10.660
<b>Well, if you will excuse me.</b>

08:11.780 --> 08:12.950
<b>What?</b>

08:18.870 --> 08:19.670
<b>I see.</b>

08:20.170 --> 08:21.420
<b>So it was Viola.</b>

08:21.540 --> 08:25.340
<b>Yeah, even Miyako-san suggesting
we do a live show</b>

08:25.460 --> 08:27.590
<b>might've been Viola's plan.</b>

08:29.800 --> 08:32.430
<b>I have to help Miyako-san.</b>

08:32.760 --> 08:36.390
<b>But for some reason,
she won't even listen to me.</b>

08:36.730 --> 08:38.770
<b>What should I do?</b>

08:40.230 --> 08:43.770
<b>Trying to convince her
head-on might be dangerous.</b>

08:44.980 --> 08:46.780
<b>Viola's words are...</b>

08:47.740 --> 08:49.740
<b>like poison hidden in honey.</b>

08:50.700 --> 08:54.870
<b>She wraps you
in words as sweet as sugar,</b>

08:56.290 --> 08:58.960
<b>and before you know it, you can't move.</b>

08:59.540 --> 09:02.170
<b>And no other choice seems possible.</b>

09:03.500 --> 09:07.460
<b>If you try to force her,
it might end up getting worse.</b>

09:07.760 --> 09:09.260
<b>Yeah...</b>

09:09.760 --> 09:12.140
<b>You're right...</b>

09:13.600 --> 09:15.140
<b>"No, Magi Armstrong!"</b>

09:15.640 --> 09:18.520
<b>"You just pushed yourself
with training."</b>

09:18.640 --> 09:21.440
<b>That's the line
from Magilulu's eighth episode!</b>

09:23.940 --> 09:26.070
<b>"Don't stop me, Magi Hamspring."</b>

09:26.190 --> 09:29.440
<b>"Even now, the Shani-comers
are fighting for the city."</b>

09:29.690 --> 09:33.450
<b>"Calm down. Your body is in
super-recovery mode right now."</b>

09:33.870 --> 09:35.950
<b>"Super-recovery"?</b>

09:37.620 --> 09:41.250
<b>"Injured muscles
get stronger by resting."</b>

09:41.790 --> 09:44.210
<b>"Pushing them harder makes it worse."</b>

09:44.830 --> 09:45.630
<b>"So..."</b>

09:47.800 --> 09:49.670
<b>"Take it slow and wait."</b>

09:52.340 --> 09:54.640
<b>That's right.</b>

09:54.760 --> 09:58.390
<b>Miyako-san must be in super-recovery.
I just have to wait.</b>

09:58.890 --> 10:00.270
<b>Thanks, Ricchan.</b>

10:00.390 --> 10:01.980
<b>You're welcome.</b>

10:04.350 --> 10:07.900
<b>You really are good
at reenacting Magilulu.</b>

10:10.150 --> 10:14.160
<b>Really? Your moves haven't lost
their edge either, Ricchan.</b>

10:17.030 --> 10:18.580
<b>Nice Bulk.</b>

10:22.210 --> 10:23.710
<b>Nice Bulk.</b>

10:28.550 --> 10:32.470
<b>Maybe Miyako-san's
a lot like how I used to be.</b>

10:33.840 --> 10:37.890
<b>She must've met Viola
and felt like everything was going well.</b>

10:38.470 --> 10:42.230
<b>Then, out of nowhere,
she's treated like the bad guy.</b>

10:44.390 --> 10:46.270
<b>And nothing makes sense.</b>

10:47.110 --> 10:48.570
<b>That's probably why...</b>

10:51.110 --> 10:55.860
<b>She truly understands me.
She's my greatest fan!</b>

10:56.070 --> 10:59.030
<b>Chupacabu Saturation</b>

10:57.160 --> 10:59.030
<b>Her greatest fan...</b>

11:00.080 --> 11:03.660
<b>Her greatest fan, huh?</b>

11:13.510 --> 11:16.380
<b>That's pretty heartbreaking,</b>

11:16.720 --> 11:19.220
<b>but there's no point in dwelling on it.</b>

11:19.350 --> 11:22.600
<b>This time, I'm definitely not losing!</b>

11:22.720 --> 11:25.810
<b>I can sing, and I can talk.
Everyone's with me.</b>

11:25.940 --> 11:27.690
<b>I won't let MewType go down.</b>

11:28.100 --> 11:30.190
<b>Reliable Ricchan.</b>

11:30.320 --> 11:33.190
<b>Healing powerhouse Nono-chan-san.</b>

11:33.360 --> 11:36.070
<b>The incredible robot Yuno-san-chan.</b>

11:36.240 --> 11:38.780
<b>And the Goddess Miyako-san.</b>

11:40.580 --> 11:42.200
<b>The ultimate team!</b>

11:48.790 --> 11:54.550
<b><i>Even if what you were looking for
somehow becomes unclear</i></b>

11:54.710 --> 11:59.800
<b><i>It's right there beside you, always
Pieces of starlight</i></b>

11:59.970 --> 12:05.390
<b><i>It's all right now, can't you see?
You can shine again</i></b>

12:05.520 --> 12:10.520
<b><i>Take a step forward, just one more step
Look toward tomorrow</i></b>

12:10.730 --> 12:14.530
<b><i>Let's face forward and move ahead</i></b>

12:26.750 --> 12:33.040
<b><i>It all started with a single word
A fleeting, tender moment</i></b>

12:33.170 --> 12:37.380
<b><i>Not having a name
feels somehow incomplete</i></b>

12:37.550 --> 12:38.970
<b><i>So I sway</i></b>

12:40.260 --> 12:41.640
<b><i>Ah...</i></b>

12:42.760 --> 12:46.770
<b><i>The heartbeat
I kept turning a blind eye to</i></b>

12:46.890 --> 12:49.020
<b><i>has pushed me forward</i></b>

12:49.140 --> 12:52.810
<b><i>If you want to change,
step out without fear</i></b>

12:52.940 --> 12:58.570
<b><i>Even if what you were looking for
somehow becomes unclear</i></b>

12:58.780 --> 13:03.780
<b><i>It's right there beside you, always
Pieces of starlight</i></b>

13:03.910 --> 13:09.540
<b><i>If you keep looking
See? You'll surely shine</i></b>

13:09.710 --> 13:14.960
<b><i>You don't have to run
Just face ahead</i></b>

13:15.090 --> 13:18.380
<b><i>Someday, you will take them</i></b>

13:22.180 --> 13:23.970
<b><i>Into your hands</i></b>

13:47.660 --> 13:49.870
<b>That was great!</b>

13:50.040 --> 13:52.710
<b>Your lyrics are so good, Arale-chan.</b>

13:53.790 --> 13:54.790
<b>Thanks.</b>

13:54.960 --> 14:00.210
<b>But I feel like I still need to hold
the last part more steadily.</b>

14:00.340 --> 14:02.010
<b>I barely pulled it off,</b>

14:02.130 --> 14:05.300
<b>but if I'm not careful,
I'll hit the wrong note.</b>

14:05.430 --> 14:07.810
<b>Oh, right. Miyako-san!</b>

14:08.060 --> 14:11.850
<b>Can you hit the note
where the chords change at the end?</b>

14:15.650 --> 14:17.230
<b>Yeah, that's it.</b>

14:18.020 --> 14:19.610
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:19.980 --> 14:22.320
<b>"You'll surely shine."</b>

14:23.570 --> 14:24.740
<b>Do you have a second?</b>

14:24.990 --> 14:26.780
<b>What is it?</b>

14:26.910 --> 14:30.240
<b>We should add a bit more sound
in the interlude.</b>

14:30.370 --> 14:33.410
<b>With two guitars,
it gets buried if we don't.</b>

14:33.540 --> 14:35.210
<b>You want to talk about this?</b>

14:35.920 --> 14:39.380
<b>It's all right. I'll think about it.</b>

14:39.500 --> 14:42.630
<b>- Thanks.
- Yuno-chan!</b>

14:45.180 --> 14:47.180
<b>What about me?</b>

14:47.800 --> 14:49.760
<b>Too wild, even as the lead.</b>

14:49.890 --> 14:53.810
<b>The wild animal
inside me just came out.</b>

14:54.390 --> 14:56.230
<b>Listen to the rhythm guitar.</b>

14:56.350 --> 14:58.190
<b>It's pretty tricky.</b>

14:58.310 --> 15:01.190
<b>I've been playing
all by myself until now.</b>

15:01.320 --> 15:03.860
<b>I'll practice with you anytime.</b>

15:04.030 --> 15:05.530
<b>Ricchan!</b>

15:05.860 --> 15:07.240
<b>Good for you.</b>

15:07.370 --> 15:11.290
<b>The real joy of a band
is when the sounds start clicking.</b>

15:13.960 --> 15:15.040
<b>What?</b>

15:16.370 --> 15:19.420
<b>I'm just happy you're enjoying this.</b>

15:21.840 --> 15:23.550
<b>It's not like that.</b>

15:23.920 --> 15:27.470
<b>Adding another guitar
opens things up musically.</b>

15:27.590 --> 15:30.050
<b>I just think the arrangement's fun.</b>

15:30.430 --> 15:31.970
<b>That's all.</b>

15:33.100 --> 15:36.060
<b>Our time's almost up.
What should we do?</b>

15:36.310 --> 15:37.520
<b>What? Already?</b>

15:37.650 --> 15:39.900
<b>Time flies when we're having fun.</b>

15:40.190 --> 15:41.730
<b>I'm heading out.</b>

15:41.860 --> 15:43.150
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

15:43.280 --> 15:44.740
<b>See you.</b>

15:52.240 --> 15:55.290
<b>Why isn't anyone mad at me?</b>

15:55.460 --> 15:57.460
<b>Erea is Arale Nakamachi?!</b>

15:55.830 --> 15:59.790
<b>If I hadn't said
I wanted to do the live show...</b>

15:57.580 --> 15:59.790
<b>Arale picking a fight</b>

15:59.920 --> 16:02.300
<b>Viola in tears
after Erea snatches Clematis</b>

16:04.710 --> 16:06.630
<b>I can't make excuses.</b>

16:07.130 --> 16:09.220
<b>That was a choice I made myself.</b>

16:10.050 --> 16:11.600
<b>But that's why...</b>

16:12.010 --> 16:15.180
<b>They're acting all friendly
and dodging the issue.</b>

16:15.310 --> 16:18.600
<b>Why don't they
just say it's all my fault?!</b>

16:18.770 --> 16:22.860
<b>Magical Physical Kululu</b>

16:21.400 --> 16:22.860
<b>Even Arale-san...</b>

16:23.820 --> 16:27.950
<b>She's totally different in real life
compared to the videos.</b>

16:40.630 --> 16:42.000
<b>Editor
Incoming Call</b>

16:43.630 --> 16:44.590
<b>Hello.</b>

16:44.710 --> 16:47.260
<b>Fujimi-sensei, I hope you're doing well.</b>

16:47.800 --> 16:52.180
<b>Your storyboard has been approved,
so please go ahead and proceed.</b>

16:52.300 --> 16:53.100
<b>Understood.</b>

16:53.220 --> 16:55.510
<b>So, for the first draft,</b>

16:55.850 --> 16:58.890
<b>is it okay to follow the usual schedule?</b>

17:00.060 --> 17:01.400
<b>Yes.</b>

17:01.520 --> 17:06.190
<b>I know that things
are pretty hectic for you right now.</b>

17:07.070 --> 17:10.240
<b>It seems personal,
so there isn't much we can do,</b>

17:10.660 --> 17:14.410
<b>but if the schedule
is too tight for you,</b>

17:14.530 --> 17:19.410
<b>we can manage
a one-week break if necessary.</b>

17:20.460 --> 17:23.380
<b>We'd like to keep the story rolling,</b>

17:21.580 --> 17:26.000
<b>I can't even shine with my manga?</b>

17:23.500 --> 17:26.000
<b>but your well-being comes first.</b>

17:26.300 --> 17:27.880
<b>The manga's not even all that</b>

17:28.050 --> 17:31.130
<b>Editor
Call Ended</b>

17:29.670 --> 17:31.130
<b>I...</b>

17:33.550 --> 17:35.050
<b>I...</b>

17:39.270 --> 17:42.310
<b>I have a feeling
Miyako-chan needs emergency help.</b>

17:42.810 --> 17:44.650
<b>I'll give her first aid!</b>

17:44.980 --> 17:47.320
<b>Shiroyama</b>

17:50.400 --> 17:53.320
<b>So, what exactly are you doing?</b>

17:53.450 --> 17:55.830
<b>I'm examining you.</b>

17:57.490 --> 18:00.830
<b>You looked like you were in pain.</b>

18:01.870 --> 18:03.580
<b>Must be your imagination.</b>

18:03.750 --> 18:08.880
<b>No, the magnificent
Dr. Nono-chan's eyes won't be fooled.</b>

18:10.210 --> 18:12.090
<b>You don't need to worry.</b>

18:13.220 --> 18:16.100
<b>You've been working really hard.</b>

18:16.550 --> 18:19.810
<b>Drawing manga, playing the keyboard...</b>

18:19.930 --> 18:23.350
<b>I think you're amazing for doing it all,</b>

18:23.480 --> 18:26.060
<b>so don't feel down.</b>

18:26.650 --> 18:30.990
<b>I'll give you lots and lots of
pats and cuddles!</b>

18:31.280 --> 18:33.990
<b>Working hard is nothing special.</b>

18:34.530 --> 18:35.740
<b>Anyone can do it.</b>

18:35.870 --> 18:39.200
<b>That's not true. It's incredible!</b>

18:39.330 --> 18:42.370
<b>Then why am I so...</b>

18:47.340 --> 18:49.670
<b>That's enough.</b>

18:51.800 --> 18:55.800
<b>Miyako-chan, you must be
in such deep sorrow.</b>

18:55.930 --> 18:59.890
<b>For you, I have a very special medicine.</b>

19:01.930 --> 19:03.310
<b>Smooch!</b>

19:03.930 --> 19:04.890
<b>Huh?</b>

19:10.230 --> 19:11.150
<b>Well...</b>

19:14.070 --> 19:16.490
<b>That's not your spot.</b>

19:24.330 --> 19:29.670
<b>I am a guitarist, so...</b>

19:30.130 --> 19:34.170
<b>- I'll communicate through sound.
- The super-recovery...</b>

19:48.060 --> 19:49.730
<b>- How's that?
- How's what?</b>

19:49.860 --> 19:51.110
<b>I call this song</b>

19:51.270 --> 19:53.900
<b>"You Get a Gold Star"!</b>

19:56.150 --> 19:58.200
<b>It means that no one's at fault</b>

19:58.320 --> 20:01.990
<b>and that everyone's amazing
just for being alive.</b>

20:02.120 --> 20:05.450
<b>So, Miyako-chan,
don't let the bad stuff bother you,</b>

20:05.580 --> 20:07.920
<b>and let's have fun with the band.</b>

20:14.130 --> 20:16.090
<b>Are you serious?</b>

20:17.550 --> 20:18.800
<b>I caused an uproar,</b>

20:19.260 --> 20:22.760
<b>and it's still
creating chaos as we speak.</b>

20:22.890 --> 20:25.100
<b>And you're saying I'm not at fault?</b>

20:35.940 --> 20:39.110
<b>Can we stop pretending
like everything's perfect?</b>

20:39.660 --> 20:44.620
<b>I'm sorry to tell you this,
but the world isn't that simple.</b>

20:44.740 --> 20:46.450
<b>It's far more complicated.</b>

20:46.580 --> 20:50.710
<b>And yet, you splash around
in the shallow end,</b>

20:50.880 --> 20:54.960
<b>handing your little fantasy world
to others like it's nothing.</b>

20:55.380 --> 20:58.470
<b>Am I a villain
for not following your cheer?</b>

20:58.840 --> 21:01.760
<b>Not everyone can be saved by liveliness!</b>

21:03.140 --> 21:04.760
<b>You preach what's right,</b>

21:05.260 --> 21:08.560
<b>but I can't stand the way</b>

21:08.680 --> 21:11.400
<b>my heart isn't pure like yours.</b>

21:11.520 --> 21:14.110
<b>And all I can do is lash out.</b>

21:14.440 --> 21:16.320
<b>That's the kind of person I am!</b>

21:16.440 --> 21:18.530
<b>- Miyako-chan...
- I know!</b>

21:18.650 --> 21:23.280
<b>I know that you mean no harm
and that I'm the one in the wrong.</b>

21:24.450 --> 21:28.950
<b>So please, don't ever talk to me again.</b>

21:29.830 --> 21:33.580
<b>I... I hate you!</b>

21:47.560 --> 21:48.680
<b>Yuno-san-chan.</b>

21:48.810 --> 21:51.350
<b>I'm quitting the band.</b>

21:55.980 --> 22:03.740
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.860 --> 22:07.580
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.700 --> 22:15.630
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.590 --> 22:27.300
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.430 --> 22:35.150
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.650 --> 22:43.150
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.740 --> 22:51.410
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i></b>

22:53.000 --> 23:00.800
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.920 --> 23:04.680
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.800 --> 23:11.850
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.600 --> 23:19.610
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:26.160 --> 23:29.620
<b>An extra-large order of fries,
and a jumbo yakisoba...</b>

23:29.740 --> 23:33.000
<b>Chicken nuggets, takoyaki,
potato chips, popcorn,</b>

23:33.120 --> 23:35.460
<b>soy sauce ramen, and tonkotsu ramen...</b>

23:35.580 --> 23:39.710
<b>And also a thick-cut French toast
and a deluxe sweet parfait.</b>

23:37.370 --> 23:39.920
<b>Disbandment</b>
